[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7442.79, "timestamp": "02:04:02", "text": "そうですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7447.109, "timestamp": "02:04:07", "text": "持続する。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7449.83, "timestamp": "02:04:09", "text": "おっと。呪文はありません。あなたが望むなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7452.47, "timestamp": "02:04:12", "text": "もしあなたがそうなら、そうですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7454.87, "timestamp": "02:04:14", "text": "うん。そうそう。私が行きます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7456.47, "timestamp": "02:04:16", "text": "そして、おそらく、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7460.629, "timestamp": "02:04:20", "text": "マナに関しては、あなたはマナを使い果たすことはありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7462.47, "timestamp": "02:04:22", "text": "これらのもの、つまり呪文のためのマナ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7464.79, "timestamp": "02:04:24", "text": "これはいつでも唱えることができます。おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7466.229, "timestamp": "02:04:26", "text": "魔法の石のようなものが生み出す"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7468.07, "timestamp": "02:04:28", "text": "炎とトーアはいつでも唱えることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7469.91, "timestamp": "02:04:29", "text": "それを必要とするものは、第１レベルのようなものです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7473.189, "timestamp": "02:04:33", "text": "そして、これらより上には、ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7478.149, "timestamp": "02:04:38", "text": "ここにあるものはすべて、えーっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7479.91, "timestamp": "02:04:39", "text": "マナとかそういう類。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7482.629, "timestamp": "02:04:42", "text": "ああ、神様。チリにしようかな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7483.189, "timestamp": "02:04:43", "text": "あれ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7484.629, "timestamp": "02:04:44", "text": "よし。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7487.51, "timestamp": "02:04:47", "text": "だから、もし私が近接攻撃に切り替えるなら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7487.99, "timestamp": "02:04:47", "text": "それ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7489.99, "timestamp": "02:04:49", "text": "わかった。よし。今あなたの能力は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7491.669, "timestamp": "02:04:51", "text": "スコア。あなたもできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7493.51, "timestamp": "02:04:53", "text": "ステータスを上げましょう。どんなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7496.31, "timestamp": "02:04:56", "text": "増やしたいですか？申し訳ありませんが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7498.07, "timestamp": "02:04:58", "text": "呪文を追加しようと思います"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7499.279, "timestamp": "02:04:59", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hi"}]